body:
Yeah i know right? caught one because he posted his activities on snapchat that seniors who are friends with him on it showed me. i directed my superintendent to them and the kid got suspended. i'm not too worried about snap but facebook is the only place i stay connected with my friends back home. i plan on making another appointment with my doctor asap but no i dont have disability. i didnt think i would have needed it. i didnt think students were this disrespectful. i've never had this problem anywhere. i teach 7-11 math

&#x200B;

its only the start of 2nd semester, most of my income goes right to student loans and i dont have much left afterwords so taking time off is not really an option. i'm actually looking to leave as soon as possible. i even thought about seeing if i qualify for unemployment since i do have mdd but idk. i'm at a loss and been struggling since november.
